id=xiaomi_mifi_web
name=Android-Hotspot-Web
version=1.7.8-beta
versionCode=1728
author=chenchaosuperman
description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, MAC blacklist/whitelist, scheduling, SMS forward, Mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk/Bark notifications, hidden SSID, device diagnostics. Generic Android compatibility via Hotspot Compatibility Layer (capability-driven; system SoftApConfiguration as single source of truth; writes via Framework setSoftApConfiguration(config,packageName) Binder Bridge, AOSP signatures; hotspot on/off via system Tethering, cmd wifi only as OEM fallback). Verified: Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16 / KernelSU. v1.7.8-beta: SoftAP state judged by Framework onStateChanged (10-14, failure reason 0 never a failure, final state wins), hotspot_get_state 4-tier priority (Bridge softap-state > dumpsys snapshot > tether-state > iface), SoftApBridge softap-state command, hotspot_stop refuses fake success, unified hotspotState (ON/STARTING/OFF/STOPPING/ERROR/UNKNOWN) in header & home, concise error text, tablet/desktop responsive layout (960/1200px, 6-col nav, full-row notices, responsive modal), dynamic max clients from SoftApCapability. v1.7.7-beta: Compatibility & Reliability.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenchaosuperman-cell/Android-Hotspot-Web/main/update.json
